# Service 层规范

## 1. 分层架构

```
页面/组件/Store ──→ Service 层（接口契约）──→ Mock / API
                          │
                       Store 层（状态缓存）
```

- **Service 层**：`src/services/` — 接口契约，定义业务可用的操作
- **Mock 层**：`src/data/` — 当前实现，联调时整体替换为 API 调用
- **API 层**：`src/utils/request.ts` — Taro.request 封装，自动 Token / 401 跳转 / 超时

**铁律：页面/组件/Store 只能从 `@/services` 导入，禁止直接引用 `@/data/*`。**

## 2. 目录结构

```
src/services/
├── index.ts          # 统一导出（页面/Store 只从此文件导入）
├── auth.ts           # 认证
├── student.ts        # 学员
├── teacher.ts        # 教师
├── campus.ts         # 校区
├── home.ts           # 首页
├── statistics.ts     # 统计
├── lead.ts           # 线索
├── feedback.ts       # 反馈
├── upload.ts         # 上传
└── temporary-reschedule.ts  # 临时调课
```

每个模块导出 Service 对象：

```ts
// services/teacher.ts
export const teacherService = { ... };
export const salaryModelService = { ... };
export const salarySettingsService = { ... };
```

## 3. Service 标准模板

```ts
// src/services/teacher.ts
/**
 * Service 层 — 教师管理 API
 * 定义接口契约，当前由 mock 实现，联调时替换为 request 调用
 */
import { get, post, put, del } from '@/utils/request';
import {
  mockGetTeachers,
  mockAddTeacher,
  mockUpdateTeacher,
  mockConfirmSalary,
} from '@/data/teacher';
import type { TeacherUIModel, SalaryModel, Deduction } from '@/types/teacher';

// ============================================
// 教师 Service
// ============================================
export const teacherService = {
  /** 获取教师列表 */
  getList: (campusId?: string, month?: string) => mockGetTeachers(campusId, month),
  // 联调时替换为：
  // getList: (campusId?: string, month?: string) =>
  //   get<TeacherUIModel[]>('/api/teachers', { campusId, month }),

  /** 获取在职教师列表（用于班级表单选择器） */
  getActiveList: (campusId?: string) => mockGetActiveTeachers(campusId),

  /** 获取教师详情 */
  getById: (id: string) => mockGetTeacherById(id),

  /** 添加教师 */
  add: (teacher: TeacherUIModel) => mockAddTeacher(teacher),

  /** 更新教师信息 */
  update: (id: string, updates: Partial<TeacherUIModel>) => mockUpdateTeacher(id, updates),

  /** 确认薪资 */
  confirmSalary: (id: string) => mockConfirmSalary(id),

  /** 批量确认薪资 */
  batchConfirm: (ids: string[]) => mockBatchConfirm(ids),

  /** 发放薪资 */
  executePay: (ids: string[], remark?: string, payMethod?: string) =>
    mockExecutePay(ids, remark, payMethod),

  /** 教师离职 */
  resign: (id: string, resignType: string, reason?: string) =>
    mockResignTeacher(id, resignType, reason),
};

// ============================================
// 薪资模型 Service
// ============================================
export const salaryModelService = {
  getList: () => mockGetSalaryModels(),
  create: (model: SalaryModel) => mockCreateSalaryModel(model),
  update: (id: string, model: Partial<SalaryModel>) => mockUpdateSalaryModel(id, model),
};
```

## 4. 命名规范

| 操作 | 方法名 | 示例 |
|---|---|---|
| 查询列表 | `getList` / `getAll` | `teacherService.getList()` |
| 查询详情 | `getById` | `teacherService.getById(id)` |
| 新增 | `add` / `create` | `teacherService.add(data)` |
| 更新 | `update` | `teacherService.update(id, data)` |
| 删除 | `remove` / `delete` | `teacherService.remove(id)` |
| 业务操作 | 动词开头 | `teacherService.confirmSalary(id)` |
| 批量操作 | `batch` 前缀 | `teacherService.batchConfirm(ids)` |
| 发送类操作 | `send` 前缀 | `teacherService.sendSalarySlip(ids)` |

## 5. 返回值规范

```ts
export const teacherService = {
  // ✅ 列表返回完整类型
  getList: () => mockGetTeachers(),                                    // → TeacherUIModel[]

  // ✅ 单个返回对象或 null
